  "title": "INFINITELY MANY RIEMANN SURFACES WITH A TRANSITIVE ACTION ON THE WEIERSTRASS POINTS",
  "authors_raw": "SEBASTIÁN REYES-CAROCCA AND PIETRO SPEZIALI",
  "title_lines": [
   "INFINITELY MANY RIEMANN SURFACES WITH A",
   "TRANSITIVE ACTION ON THE WEIERSTRASS POINTS"
  ],
  "abstract": "In this short note, we prove the existence of inﬁnitely many pairwise non-isomorphic, non-hyperelliptic Riemann surfaces with automorphism group act- ing transitively on the Weierstrass points. We also ﬁnd all compact Riemann sur- faces with automorphism group acting transitively on the Weierstrass points, under the assumption that they are simple.",
